4A4AB97F083D2231","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"If one of us fell, the other would look after his family.","female":"If one of us fell, the other would look after his family.","variant_male_record_index":"191552","variant_female_record_index":"191553","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511468006:0":{"text":"But now... I don't know how to face them.","source_cn":"但现在……我不知道该怎么面对他们。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x11DB654AF4B46F42","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"But now... I don't know how to face them.","female":"But now... I don't know how to face them.","variant_male_record_index":"191554","variant_female_record_index":"191555","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511468007:0":{"text":"I survived, and became this ridiculous \"champion\"... but Dunn will never return.","source_cn":"我活着，还成了这可笑的勇士……顿却再也回不来了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9C7E4709CD57B337","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I survived, and became this ridiculous \"champion\"... but Dunn will never return.","female":"I survived, and became this ridiculous \"champion\"... but Dunn will never return.","variant_male_record_index":"191556","variant_female_record_index":"191557","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1511468007":{"text":"I survived, and became this ridiculous \"champion\"... but Dunn will never return.","source_cn":"我活着，还成了这可笑的勇士……顿却再也回不来了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9C7E4709CD57B337","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I survived, and became this ridiculous \"champion\"... but Dunn will never return.","female":"I survived, and became this ri